{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1320708001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 덕분에 이렇게 빨리 끝낼 수 있었어요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA7FCC1147580AA06","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 덕분에 이렇게 빨리 끝낼 수 있었어요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 덕분에 이렇게 빨리 끝낼 수 있었어요.","variant_male_record_index":"148330","variant_female_record_index":"148331","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320708002:1":{"text":"잘하셨어요. 하지만 할인은 힘들겠네요!","source_cn":"做得不错，但我这里永远不降价！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E72FD842CA67B81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320708003:1":{"text":"아니... 어떻게 그러실 수가 있어요!","source_cn":"怎么这样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD230A678A4A1707","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320708004:1":{"text":"하지만... 이렇게 성실하게 일해주셨으니, 이 말랭이를 공짜로 드리죠.","source_cn":"不过……看在你们这么勤快的份上，这包果脯干脆送给你好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68586EBE9CA8EB03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320708005:1":{"text":"저희 시더 마을은 손님 접대를 좋아하는 곳이니 손님이 마음 상한 체로 돌아가게 할 순 없죠.","source_cn":"我们雪松镇是好客的地方，不会让客人伤心离去的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05F1B66397BEB452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320708006:1":{"text":"감사합니다! 물건을 받았으니 더더욱 도와드려야겠네요. 물건을 어디로 배달하면 될까요?","source_cn":"谢谢你！收了你的东西，我更得帮你干活了，你的货物要送哪去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17678029BE7009DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320708007:1":{"text":"프로도라는 양치기가 있는데 얼음 결정 베리 한 상자를 주문했어요. 마을 밖으로 나가면 그의 양 우리가 보일 거예요.","source_cn":"费多尔，他是个牧羊人，找我订购了一箱冰晶莓。你出了镇子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FA207B5F42BDAF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320708008:1":{"text":"알겠어요, 바로 갈게요!","source_cn":"好嘞，马上送到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AE2B4E3BDD3F407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水果铺的瓦妮":{"text":"와니","source":"水果铺的瓦妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}